{"id": "t145-057", "text": "long call w/ Mila tonight. she finally handed in notice - last day is the 14th. boss tried to talk her out of it. new place is a startup, more money but no pension. she's nervous abt the jump but sure it's right. her flatmate Lucy is moving out at the same time so it's all happening at once. should get her a card + something for the new desk. ask her the wk after how it's going", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "handed in notice", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sure it's right", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same time", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her a card + something for the new desk", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wk after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
