{"id": "t145-060", "text": "Katarzyna (Kasia) - her brother Elijah's on the stage crew for the school play, opening night next Thurs. she wants us to come. her parents are both away so she's doing the lifts the day before for dress rehearsal and the night itself. Elijah's apparently mortified she's told everyone", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Katarzyna", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "opening night", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thurs", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dress rehearsal", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night itself", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "mortified", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
